{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/16fa650a4aaae118da56c615bce749b4.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a seasoned adventurer in pursuit of the fabled Sword of Cietri, a mystical blade that only appears once every 100 years for just 24 hours. At the penultimate moment of success, a sudden mysterious voice informs you that the sword\u2019s power can only be unlocked by &quot;joining with another in body and spirit\u2026&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and your only choices are three strangers who, by a convergence of fates, were also seeking the fabled blade, and moments ago were just trying to kill you.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enshrined is a fully-voiced dark fantasy visual novel that gives the player the chance to decide their fate and who, ultimately, will leave with the coveted sword.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three distinct character backgrounds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/f60581bbbdb7df8ae863237cba8cadf6.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=290 /></span>\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JYNDI</strong>: A hardy warrior people locked in a struggle with oblivion.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/b88d5a000b265117293122e77ccc2bd3.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=290 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FALLEN</strong>: Angels cast from the heavens and banished by their divine masters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/fab16a96037f397a5b7a9bf7123ae93d.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUMAN</strong>: Resourceful adventurers imbued with a talent for magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring unique dialogue across all three distinct story routes, with multiple possible endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect CGs across 3 different routes, one good end and 6 bonus illustrations per route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features gamepad rumble support for an enhanced... <strong>tactile</strong> experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enshrined is fully-voiced by a veteran cast, featuring the talents of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SungWon Cho</strong> as Jun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jonah Scott</strong> as Niko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dave Fennoy</strong> as Dyma.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: <strong>No generative or assistive AI was used at any point in the production of this game;</strong>\u00a0This includes artwork, music, programming, voice acting, and QA.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835610?t=1759199006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/e10f97c01734f01e2e35c32ed53f0248cde3bab7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759199006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/243bee22f7431f927e8ad1aebfabf7d0f6e88cc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759199006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/243bee22f7431f927e8ad1aebfabf7d0f6e88cc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759199006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game's sexual content is non-explicit and text-only."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/16fa650a4aaae118da56c615bce749b4.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a seasoned adventurer in pursuit of the fabled Sword of Cietri, a mystical blade that only appears once every 100 years for just 24 hours. At the penultimate moment of success, a sudden mysterious voice informs you that the sword\u2019s power can only be unlocked by &quot;joining with another in body and spirit\u2026&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and your only choices are three strangers who, by a convergence of fates, were also seeking the fabled blade, and moments ago were just trying to kill you.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enshrined is a fully-voiced dark fantasy visual novel that gives the player the chance to decide their fate and who, ultimately, will leave with the coveted sword.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three distinct character backgrounds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/f60581bbbdb7df8ae863237cba8cadf6.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=290 /></span>\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JYNDI</strong>: A hardy warrior people locked in a struggle with oblivion.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/b88d5a000b265117293122e77ccc2bd3.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=290 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FALLEN</strong>: Angels cast from the heavens and banished by their divine masters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/extras/fab16a96037f397a5b7a9bf7123ae93d.avif?t=1759199006\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUMAN</strong>: Resourceful adventurers imbued with a talent for magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring unique dialogue across all three distinct story routes, with multiple possible endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect CGs across 3 different routes, one good end and 6 bonus illustrations per route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features gamepad rumble support for an enhanced... <strong>tactile</strong> experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enshrined is fully-voiced by a veteran cast, featuring the talents of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SungWon Cho</strong> as Jun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jonah Scott</strong> as Niko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dave Fennoy</strong> as Dyma.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: <strong>No generative or assistive AI was used at any point in the production of this game;</strong>\u00a0This includes artwork, music, programming, voice acting, and QA.</p>","developers":["Truant Pixel, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835610/92d18502abd9de0d6d7a67ba326b3c3bd2f8c0d4/header.jpg?t=1759199006","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright (c) 2025 Truant Pixel, LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3835610/1505077642/dafe891bc2f423b510f8fd38a2f059b5d954cf61/1757432147/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759196544","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3835610/1505077642/dafe891bc2f423b510f8fd38a2f059b5d954cf61/1757432147/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759196544","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3835610/1505077642/dafe891bc2f423b510f8fd38a2f059b5d954cf61/1757432147/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759196544","id":257195117,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195117/movie480.mp4?t=1759196544","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195117/movie_max.mp4?t=1759196544"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumb